{"height": 16, "weight": 460, "base_experience": 248, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "special-attack", "value": 3}], "genus": "Sun Pokémon", "capture_rate": 15, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 40, "growth_rate": "slow", "egg_groups": ["bug"], "gender_rate": 4, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ウルガモス"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Ulgamoth"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "불카모스"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "火神蛾"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Pyrax"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Ramoth"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Volcarona"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Volcarona"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ウルガモス"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "火神蛾"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Volcarona"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["black", "y", "alpha-sapphire"], "text": "When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun."}, {"versions": ["white", "x", "omega-ruby"], "text": "A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales."}, {"versions": ["black-2", "white-2"], "text": "Thought to be an embodiment of the sun, it appeared during a bitterly cold winter and saved Pokémon from freezing."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "As it flies, it scatters its flaming scales. It was feared by ancient people, who referred to it as “the rage of the sun.”"}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "Volcarona scatters burning scales. Some say it does this to start fires. Others say it’s trying to rescue those that suffer in the cold."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "This Pokémon emerges from a cocoon formed of raging flames. Ancient murals depict Volcarona as a deity of fire."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sp